<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Harnessing Uncertainty: Entropy-Modulated Policy Gradients for Long-Horizon LLM Agents</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Jiawei Wang
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Jiacai Liu
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yuqian Fu
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
